-- title:
--   Gaussian decision-to-search data and native circuit interfaces
-- statement:
--   This package defines the finite Gaussian laws, candidate and verification data, recovery budgets, quantum output and native serialization interfaces used by the already checked decision-to-search implementation. It retains the original code and data, including finite Gaussian normalization fields, Gaussian verification parameters, blinded candidate selection data, native multi-output circuit descriptions, and the binary encodings used by the original integer-basis LWE producer. Quantitative decision-to-search success, source-transfer and uniform QPT conclusions are submitted separately as theorem proofs.
-- source:
